       "text": "I haven't entered this order. As written, it is well above the maximum ibuprofen dose.\n\n- **Dose:** 1600 mg is double the usual maximum single oral dose of 800 mg.\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day, and most inpatient use stays at or below 2,400 mg/day. This amount risks GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day total)\n- **800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day total)\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day total, the absolute maximum)\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want, and I'll enter it right away. If you do intend 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and give the clinical rationale. I'd still advise against entering it, and I'd want it checked with pharmacy or your attending first."
